```elixir
```

## The study's structure

```elixir
CastorEDC.Kino.study(client, study_id)
```

## Participants

Pages render as tables, and records as trees.

```elixir
participants = CastorEDC.Participants.list_participants!(client, study_id)
```

```elixir
hd(participants.entries)
```

## Collected data

This cell loads the study's values: as rows here, or as Explorer or Dux frames when the `ex_castor_edc_explorer` or `ex_castor_edc_dux` package is installed.

